== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that follows Isaac around, leaving a trail of [[red creep]] that damages enemies.
** The creep deals 2 damage per tick or 6 damage per second to non-flying enemies.
** {{Dlc|r}} The creep deals damage much more rapidly at 20 damage per second.
* {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Headless Baby having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|Lost Cork}}: Creep trail size is bigger.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Familiar is bigger; however, no effect on creep damage.

